// Curation for text/books — one entry per livelib edition id.
// JSONC: // and /* */ comments are stripped by load_curation() before parse.
//
// books — per-edition curation: weight?, status?, my_mark?, author?,
//         merges? [other edition id] — that edition's quotes/review belong to
//         THIS note (only where livelib lists no shared work).
// The // lines above each entry (and above each merges member) are that
// edition's title and url, for reading the file by eye; the build reads none.
//
// Nothing else is stored. A work the TEXTS cite but no shelf holds needs no
// entry: the build scans text/*.md for livelib ids and takes title/author from
// the edition card JSON (/art-editions/{id}), cached in livelib-export/.
